    LLM: 'Preflop betting (player to left of big blind starts; big blind acts last). Dealer burns one, deals three community cards (flop); betting round. Burn one, deal one (turn); betting round. Burn one, deal one (river); final betting round. Showdown: active players show all six hole cards; best five-card hand using exactly two hole and three board wins. Pot Limit common.',
